@startuml culture-governance-boundary
title Culture / Governance Boundary ; per ADR-ES-026 section 6 + Recon-ES-003

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Culture" as Cult
class "Governance" as Gov

Cult --> Gov : shapes

note right of Gov
  Per Recon-ES-003:
  Governance is the formal structure
  (Authority, Policy, Constraint).
  Culture is the shared meaning that
  legitimizes and modifies Governance.

  Culture is NOT Governance.
end note

@enduml
